 "about": "The map's vocabulary: every terrain, landmark, line, hexside feature and river kind the map data may use, with its name. The server checks corrections against it and sends it to the browser (/api/vocab), which adds colours and keys (web/shared/vocab.js). Lines are listed in the order a hexside's crossings are stored; a line's family is what it continues for continuity checks.",
